{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Daily Driven Racer</strong> is about racing everyday cars, or sleeper cars, on uniquely designed tracks. Each track has a different look and feel, providing a fresh experience every time. The driving mechanics blend arcade fun with simulation realism, ensuring that both casual and hardcore racing fans can enjoy the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Single Player Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Grand Tour Mode (Arcade):</strong> Participate in a series of races and progress as you win each race to conquer the tour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Circuit Race:</strong> Compete against AI opponents in various tracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sprint Race:</strong> Race against AI in short, point to point races.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Racer Duel:</strong> Face off in 1v1 challenges against AI opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Time Trial:</strong> Race against yourself to achieve the best time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Split-Screen Multiplayer:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with up to 4 players in local split-screen for more excitement and fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Circuit Race:</strong> Compete against players, AI opponents, or a combination of both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sprint Race:</strong> Race against players, AI, or a combination of both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cops and Robbers Mode:</strong> One player takes on the role of the cop while the other plays as the robber in exciting chases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Battle Mode:</strong> Engage in vehicular combat and be the last car standing with a unique jump-to-win mechanic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cruise: </strong>free roam with friends with no specific objective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.s